# Worker secrets for `wrangler dev`. The deployed equivalent is `wrangler secret put`.
.dev.vars
.wrangler

# Hero-video working files. Reference art downloaded from chain (scripts/prep-refs.mjs)
# and raw MiniMax renders (scripts/gen-video.mjs). Large, reproducible, and only the
# encoded result belongs in git — see public/hero/.
assets/refs/
assets/renders/
assets/audio/candidates/
# Generated 3D assets, wherever they land. Meshes are large (3-15MB each), reproducible from
# scripts/probe-mesh.mjs and the recorded task ids, and in production they live in R2 rather than
# in the repo at all. Ignored by EXTENSION rather than by directory on purpose: the round-9 rule
# only covered assets/probes/mesh-round9/, so the next round writing to mesh-round10/ would have
# committed 80MB of binaries without anyone noticing.
*.glb
*.gltf
assets/probes/mesh-round9/
